                  <textLang mainLang="gez">Gǝ'ǝz</textLang>
                </msItem>
                <msItem xml:id="ms_i4">
                  <locus from="45r" to="49r" facs="046"/>
                  <title>Prayer of Repentance for the Love of Money, <foreign xml:lang="gez">ሥርዋ፡ ለኃጢአት፡</foreign></title>
                  <note>The work appears to have portions of other works, including <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT1398Fethat">Fǝtḥat za-wald</ref>, and the text of the penitential Maṣḥafa nuzāze in <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BAVborget22#ms_1">Vatican City, Biblioteca Apostolica Vaticana, Vat. Borg. et. 22:  ms_1</ref></note>
